# 🕹️ The playground run menu: pick an example, see its options, quit without running anything
Output docs/videos/run-menu.mp4
Source tapes/settings.tape
Set Width 1400
Set Height 820
Source tapes/prelude.tape

Type "playground run"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
# 🔗 Connectors
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type@120ms "jdbc postgres sink"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 4s
Down@600ms 12
Sleep 3s
Up@400ms 6
Sleep 3s
# quit without running anything
Escape
Sleep 2s
